            <p class="section-subheading">The Quartet</p>
            <h1 class="section-heading">About Us</h1>
            <div class="section-divider"></div>
            <p class="banner-description">Four young Canadian singers united by a love of barbershop harmony. Formed in 2024 through the Young Singers in Harmony program and the Cloverdale Chordsmen, Lock-in' Ringers are dedicated to bringing the timeless sound of four-part a cappella to audiences across Canada.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story">
